WEBVTT

01:40.550 --> 01:44.229
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.140 --> 01:47.310
[Episode 35]

01:48.920 --> 01:50.870
He's waiting for someone.

01:52.000 --> 01:53.039
And I

01:54.400 --> 01:55.840
am also waiting.

02:36.100 --> 02:37.420
We'll split up into two groups.

02:37.470 --> 02:39.120
Mei Shan and I will launch an attack on the front gate

02:39.120 --> 02:40.680
to keep the Demon Lord and Hannv occupied,

02:40.680 --> 02:41.680
preventing them from descending the mountain

02:41.680 --> 02:42.750
and causing chaos in the world.

02:43.190 --> 02:45.120
Qian Lin and Zhi Dai will lead the human warriors

02:45.120 --> 02:46.150
to assault Tianqu Peak

02:46.150 --> 02:47.590
and rescue Tanghua and the others.

02:47.630 --> 02:48.400
Yes.

02:48.400 --> 02:49.079
Yes.

02:50.120 --> 02:51.240
I'm now counting on you all.

02:51.310 --> 02:53.310
Swear to eradicate the Demon Lord!

02:53.470 --> 02:55.400
Swear to eradicate the Demon Lord!

02:55.710 --> 02:57.590
Swear to eradicate the Demon Lord!

02:57.710 --> 02:59.630
Swear to eradicate the Demon Lord!

02:59.630 --> 03:01.560
Swear to eradicate the Demon Lord!

03:01.750 --> 03:03.680
Swear to eradicate the Demon Lord!

03:23.400 --> 03:24.360
Elder Xinyao.

03:24.680 --> 03:26.079
How's your injury?

03:26.280 --> 03:27.190
I'm fine.

04:09.470 --> 04:10.910
Who dares to make a scene here?

04:16.190 --> 04:17.360
Ji Tanyin,

04:17.680 --> 04:19.070
you're still alive.

04:19.920 --> 04:20.720
Do you know each other?

04:21.480 --> 04:22.390
No.

04:22.480 --> 04:23.560
You insolent fool,

04:24.270 --> 04:26.560
I have received enlightenment from the Lord,

04:26.560 --> 04:28.040
and my powers have greatly increased.

04:28.240 --> 04:29.920
If you don't want to die by my hand,

04:30.070 --> 04:31.430
you'd better leave now.

04:40.850 --> 04:42.170
You're no match for me.

04:48.040 --> 04:49.000
You won't be able to kill them all.

04:49.240 --> 04:50.190
Hurry up and go up the mountain!

05:11.270 --> 05:12.040
Let's go!

05:12.040 --> 05:12.720
Let's go!

05:17.430 --> 05:18.270
Go down the mountain!

05:18.310 --> 05:19.360
Powerful enemies are invading!

05:19.360 --> 05:20.510
Powerful enemies are invading!

05:22.360 --> 05:23.160
Hurry!

05:39.560 --> 05:40.360
Wait.

05:40.920 --> 05:42.159
Don't fall for the trap meant to distract us.

05:42.159 --> 05:43.600
Take a team and head to the dungeon.

05:43.600 --> 05:44.390
Keep an eye on the prisoners.

05:44.390 --> 05:45.630
The rest of you, follow me.

05:45.750 --> 05:46.560
Come with me,

05:58.310 --> 05:59.510
I'll hold them off here.

05:59.510 --> 06:00.510
You go in and rescue the others.

06:02.270 --> 06:03.040
Don't even try it.

06:43.200 --> 06:43.909
Zhi Dai!

06:46.240 --> 06:46.600
Young Master.

06:46.600 --> 06:47.600
Everyone, hurry up and leave!

06:48.000 --> 06:49.310
Go!

07:10.070 --> 07:10.920
We'll stay here.

07:10.920 --> 07:12.360
You and Tanghua, go help Ji Tanyin.

07:12.360 --> 07:13.600
The rest of you, leave quickly.

07:13.630 --> 07:14.800
Alright, let's go!

07:39.510 --> 07:41.000
You really are lucky.

07:41.430 --> 07:42.270
Even the Heavenly Furnace

07:42.270 --> 07:43.830
couldn't burn you away.

07:44.120 --> 07:45.360
Back to die again?

07:45.630 --> 07:47.070
I'm sending you to your grave.

07:59.430 --> 08:01.270
Sir, your skills are remarkable.

08:01.600 --> 08:03.310
Do you ever consider defecting to the light?

08:03.430 --> 08:05.430
You, a god, serve the demon,

08:05.680 --> 08:07.190
yet still dare to call yourself righteous?

08:08.110 --> 08:09.270
I didn't ask for your opinion.

08:09.680 --> 08:10.480
Sir,

08:11.040 --> 08:11.950
I've given you a chance.

08:12.530 --> 08:13.760
What will you choose?

08:15.480 --> 08:16.720
Your heart is tainted,

08:16.720 --> 08:17.870
and you can't tell right from wrong.

08:18.190 --> 08:19.750
I don't want to deal with people like you.

08:20.160 --> 08:21.600
Rough and crude.

08:21.720 --> 08:23.480
No wonder you haven't ascended to godhood yet.

08:24.070 --> 08:25.360
Since you refuse to follow the righteous path,

08:25.360 --> 08:26.870
I'll send you to hell.

09:05.000 --> 09:06.720
You foolish, clueless thing.

09:07.390 --> 09:08.840
Do you think I can't kill you?

09:09.630 --> 09:11.270
I've always looked down on you.

09:11.440 --> 09:13.000
You're a god, yet you refuse to act like one,

09:13.120 --> 09:14.870
becoming a servant to the demon.

09:16.750 --> 09:17.550
Watch out!

09:22.720 --> 09:23.790
What incredible power!

09:23.790 --> 09:24.550
I'm going in.

09:24.550 --> 09:25.510
Hold her off for me.

09:25.510 --> 09:26.240
Don't worry.

09:26.240 --> 09:27.200
Go ahead.

09:27.550 --> 09:28.840
Even if the sky falls today,

09:28.840 --> 09:30.240
I'll hold it up for you.

09:32.510 --> 09:33.320
Don't leave!

09:46.390 --> 09:47.630
You didn't die?

09:48.510 --> 09:50.200
Do you think I've withstood decades of heavenly thunder

09:50.200 --> 09:50.960
for nothing?

09:51.390 --> 09:53.240
Your magic is indeed powerful,

09:53.600 --> 09:55.000
but compared to the lightning tribulation,

09:55.270 --> 09:56.480
it still falls short.

09:57.030 --> 09:58.320
You reckless fool, just go to hell!

10:09.960 --> 10:11.790
Disturbing people's peaceful rest,

10:12.320 --> 10:14.390
you have no sense of decency.

10:14.510 --> 10:15.870
You've taken someone else's body

10:16.070 --> 10:17.240
and palace.

10:17.320 --> 10:18.670
Don't act like you're following the rules.

10:23.630 --> 10:24.440
Good.

10:26.030 --> 10:27.030
Well said.

10:27.720 --> 10:29.360
Since I was born,

10:29.960 --> 10:32.200
I don't know what the rules are.

10:32.510 --> 10:34.150
There's no one else here.

10:34.910 --> 10:36.600
Why don't you teach me?

10:41.320 --> 10:43.030
You seem nervous.

10:43.670 --> 10:44.840
I can sense

10:45.200 --> 10:47.240
your blood racing.

10:47.670 --> 10:49.480
You've lost your divine bone,

10:49.690 --> 10:51.380
yet you still dared to come to me.

10:52.390 --> 10:53.920
Your courage is commendable.

10:54.030 --> 10:55.200
Cut the crap.

10:56.000 --> 10:57.270
Even if I'm not a god,

10:57.320 --> 10:58.480
I'll still kill you.

10:58.910 --> 10:59.910
You were born from the evil thoughts

10:59.910 --> 11:00.910
of the Deity Taihe.

11:01.080 --> 11:02.720
You enjoy slaughter and chaos.

11:02.870 --> 11:04.270
You must be enjoying

11:04.600 --> 11:06.030
the scene outside right now, aren't you?

11:06.790 --> 11:07.600
Yes,

11:08.870 --> 11:10.480
but it's not all of it.

11:11.270 --> 11:12.870
Actually, aside from those,

11:14.790 --> 11:16.600
there's one thing

11:17.550 --> 11:19.360
I'm very curious about.

11:20.480 --> 11:21.270
What is it?

11:23.000 --> 11:23.790
You.

11:28.240 --> 11:29.510
Since my rebirth,

11:29.840 --> 11:31.360
I've slept very little.

11:32.200 --> 11:33.480
Counting just now,

11:34.080 --> 11:35.720
it's only been three times.

11:36.360 --> 11:37.910
But in all three instances,

11:38.670 --> 11:40.630
I've dreamt of you every time.

11:41.510 --> 11:42.440
I know,

11:42.790 --> 11:44.440
this isn't my feelings;

11:45.280 --> 11:46.920
it's the body's—

11:47.620 --> 11:48.980
Yuanzhong's.

11:50.040 --> 11:51.200
I'm just curious,

11:52.270 --> 11:53.360
how could someone like you,

11:53.360 --> 11:55.510
an ordinary woman,

11:56.870 --> 11:59.200
make him so reluctant

11:59.200 --> 12:00.680
to part with you?

12:05.630 --> 12:06.910
Yes.

12:07.720 --> 12:09.630
Even your temper is so bad.

12:10.150 --> 12:11.840
A woman like you,

12:12.550 --> 12:13.870
and yet he's willing to

12:13.870 --> 12:15.480
cut off his Divine Hand

12:15.720 --> 12:17.030
and even die for you.

12:18.180 --> 12:19.180
Is it worth it?

12:26.090 --> 12:28.040
It's a pity you can't see it.

12:29.240 --> 12:30.670
In those dreams,

12:31.600 --> 12:34.120
you were so beautiful,

12:35.440 --> 12:37.080
so sweet that it seemed to melt away

12:37.080 --> 12:39.200
all the world's grudges and grievances.

12:40.630 --> 12:42.480
You were perfect,

12:43.440 --> 12:44.510
perfect to the point...

12:45.630 --> 12:46.910
Perfect to the point

12:47.870 --> 12:49.630
of being sickening.

12:53.790 --> 12:55.820
The world knows me as a demon,

12:56.580 --> 12:59.580
but they don't know the suffering in my heart.

12:59.720 --> 13:01.680
Thousands of years have passed,

13:02.990 --> 13:05.320
and I've always had just one dream.

13:07.120 --> 13:08.550
In that dream,

13:09.260 --> 13:11.140
I see the world I desire.

13:12.030 --> 13:13.240
There,

13:14.310 --> 13:16.400
all those who once held their heads high

13:16.480 --> 13:18.030
now crawl and kneel before me,

13:18.030 --> 13:19.390
pitifully beneath me.

13:20.090 --> 13:22.010
All those who were once untouchable

13:22.120 --> 13:23.510
are worthless as dirt,

13:23.670 --> 13:24.960
miserably so.

13:25.240 --> 13:27.510
All those who once ruled over all

13:27.600 --> 13:29.000
are now wagging their tails and begging,

13:29.000 --> 13:30.270
waiting for a favor.

13:30.870 --> 13:33.030
And those who once sat upright,

13:33.150 --> 13:34.870
now show all their ugly traits,

13:35.120 --> 13:36.240
decaying and desolate.

13:36.480 --> 13:37.270
I want,

13:37.550 --> 13:39.240
I want that kind of world.

13:40.750 --> 13:42.840
I want the innocent to shed their garments.

13:43.120 --> 13:45.200
I want the loyal to be forsaken by all.

13:45.270 --> 13:47.320
I want the compassionate to consume their own flesh.

13:47.600 --> 13:49.720
I want the gentle to be torn and shattered.

13:50.240 --> 13:51.720
I want to tear apart

13:51.720 --> 13:54.030
the endless filthy lies

13:54.200 --> 13:55.670
and the shameless disguises

13:55.670 --> 13:56.960
that hide the sun.

13:57.360 --> 13:58.630
I want people

13:58.910 --> 14:01.550
to face the evil thoughts deep in their hearts,

14:01.670 --> 14:03.910
to recognize reality.

14:04.150 --> 14:06.000
Everyone is a demon.

14:06.080 --> 14:06.870
A demon

14:07.200 --> 14:10.270
is the truest desire of the human heart.

14:16.440 --> 14:17.360
Ji Tanyin,

14:18.840 --> 14:20.790
I didn't come out of nowhere.

14:22.000 --> 14:24.150
I was born from the human heart.

14:24.810 --> 14:25.660
So,

14:26.480 --> 14:28.840
humans are demons.

14:30.230 --> 14:31.910
Can you cut them all down?

14:32.470 --> 14:34.000
You're a madman.

14:34.000 --> 14:35.360
If I weren't,

14:35.360 --> 14:36.960
how could I be called the Demon Lord?

14:37.750 --> 14:38.750
But you,

14:39.290 --> 14:41.770
you've entered a madman's dream,

14:41.910 --> 14:43.360
aren't you the one in the wrong?

15:07.360 --> 15:10.080
Those sweet, beautiful delusions

15:10.360 --> 15:12.070
replaced my dreams,

15:13.270 --> 15:16.440
leaving me feeling disgusted and torn.

15:16.910 --> 15:18.200
Tell me,

15:19.030 --> 15:20.670
how should I punish

15:20.670 --> 15:22.480
you, the person in my dream?

15:25.240 --> 15:27.120
Do you think I'll kill you?

15:29.010 --> 15:30.720
That would be too easy for you.

15:37.480 --> 15:39.240
I want to destroy you.

15:39.510 --> 15:40.480
I want to see

15:40.480 --> 15:41.960
what's hidden

15:41.960 --> 15:43.600
beneath your perfect goddess appearance.

15:43.600 --> 15:45.510
I want to taste every bit of you,

15:45.550 --> 15:46.600
strip you down, piece by piece,

15:46.600 --> 15:48.440
drop by drop.

15:48.660 --> 15:51.330
Humiliation, torment, devourment—

15:51.720 --> 15:54.000
I want you to never be able to reincarnate!

16:01.270 --> 16:02.200
Don't be afraid.

16:03.360 --> 16:04.320
Maybe

16:05.000 --> 16:07.030
you'll enjoy it.

16:35.020 --> 16:35.810
Yuanzhong.

16:37.150 --> 16:37.960
Yuanzhong!

16:39.840 --> 16:40.630
Yuanzhong!

16:43.000 --> 16:43.790
Yuanzhong!

16:45.390 --> 16:47.510
Ji Tanyin, we're here.

17:17.880 --> 17:19.750
With that alone, you dare to call yourself the Perfect War Demon?

17:20.060 --> 17:21.369
You're really embarrassing the War Demons.

17:21.510 --> 17:22.750
Traitor!

17:23.400 --> 17:25.349
You have no right to speak in front of me.

17:25.550 --> 17:26.510
Traitor?

17:26.880 --> 17:28.200
You are the traitor!

17:28.830 --> 17:30.030
Even though our clan was severely wounded

17:30.030 --> 17:31.830
in the Battle of Pinghu sixty years ago,

17:31.830 --> 17:33.960
we never considered turning to the demons.

17:33.960 --> 17:35.160
You, as the Chief,

17:35.160 --> 17:36.270
allowed others to control you.

17:36.270 --> 17:37.480
The fault lies with you.

17:37.590 --> 17:38.720
You say I'm wrong?

17:40.160 --> 17:41.480
How laughable.

17:41.830 --> 17:43.400
Our clan fought to survive,

17:43.480 --> 17:45.350
and now we're flourishing,

17:45.440 --> 17:46.960
all thanks to my efforts.

17:47.070 --> 17:48.830
You call that living?

17:48.920 --> 17:50.310
What do the current War Demons

17:50.680 --> 17:52.310
have left,

17:52.310 --> 17:53.240
if not anger

17:53.240 --> 17:54.590
and a hunger for bloodshed?

17:54.720 --> 17:56.240
You say they're living,

17:56.270 --> 17:57.510
but to me, they're just walking,

17:57.510 --> 17:59.550
flesh-and-blood puppets.

17:59.680 --> 18:00.920
Better off dead.

18:01.680 --> 18:03.350
How many people did you sacrifice

18:03.350 --> 18:04.830
for your grand cause?

18:05.270 --> 18:07.350
You keep talking about your achievements,

18:07.640 --> 18:09.000
but to you, they're just a small footnote in the clan records,

18:09.000 --> 18:10.590
insignificant while writing about

18:10.590 --> 18:11.880
your glorious life.

18:11.880 --> 18:13.720
They were all living people!

18:14.000 --> 18:15.640
But you snuffed that out,

18:15.750 --> 18:16.790
turning them into

18:16.790 --> 18:19.000
stepping stones

18:19.160 --> 18:20.200
for your dream.

18:20.350 --> 18:21.960
But you never saw it.

18:22.110 --> 18:23.780
The path you paved all along

18:23.810 --> 18:25.610
leads to destruction.

18:26.400 --> 18:27.790
You want to kneel at the feet of the Demon Lord,

18:27.790 --> 18:28.920
to bow and submit,

18:29.720 --> 18:31.880
but once the Demon Lord's enemies are wiped out,

18:31.920 --> 18:33.920
do you think he'll leave you alive?

18:37.090 --> 18:38.720
If you crave the power of others,

18:38.750 --> 18:40.600
you'll forever be controlled by them.

18:41.330 --> 18:42.930
If you constantly set limits on yourself,

18:42.960 --> 18:44.920
you'll forget your true self.

18:45.830 --> 18:47.240
How foolish!

19:10.200 --> 19:11.030
Shiren.

19:17.690 --> 19:19.250
When you see my mother and brother,

19:19.640 --> 19:21.160
remember to ask for their forgiveness.

19:44.960 --> 19:46.030
Dingxu.

20:15.400 --> 20:16.000
Take that!

21:21.790 --> 21:23.270
Zhi Dai, how are you?

21:23.640 --> 21:24.480
Hang in there.

21:25.310 --> 21:26.110
Tanghua,

21:26.640 --> 21:27.440
I'm sorry.

21:27.440 --> 21:28.240
Quiet now,

21:28.260 --> 21:29.150
focus on your breathing.

21:34.440 --> 21:36.480
Don't waste your efforts on it.

21:37.510 --> 21:39.270
Even without this strike,

21:40.160 --> 21:41.950
I'd still meet my end.

21:42.590 --> 21:43.750
Don't say that.

21:47.720 --> 21:48.750
I'm just dying

21:49.330 --> 21:50.610
from old age.

21:55.310 --> 21:58.120
♫I gaze into your deep eyes♫

21:59.850 --> 22:03.320
♫For whom do you take apart the word "love"?♫

22:06.060 --> 22:09.490
♫Turning around, it's like a dream♫

22:10.570 --> 22:14.510
♫I have betrayed deep love♫

22:13.000 --> 22:14.550
Do you remember?

22:15.670 --> 22:17.670
I spent many years searching for you.

22:17.120 --> 22:19.960
♫Heaving a long, helpless sigh♫

22:19.440 --> 22:21.350
It wasn't until my teeth fell out

22:21.630 --> 22:24.790
♫Time flies too rapidly♫

22:22.310 --> 22:24.000
and my hair turned grey

22:24.000 --> 22:25.680
that I found you.

22:27.270 --> 22:28.270
I remember.

22:27.900 --> 22:31.350
♫Life is like a flying bird♫

22:32.490 --> 22:37.390
♫Joining, scattering, no way back♫

22:35.480 --> 22:36.550
After that,

22:37.310 --> 22:39.400
I met a goddess.

22:38.000 --> 22:41.140
♫Unable to get what I yearn for, I sink in sadness♫

22:39.830 --> 22:42.200
She fulfilled one of my wishes,

22:42.270 --> 22:44.200
and I regained my youth.

22:43.600 --> 22:46.690
♫When I brush past love, fate is set♫

22:46.310 --> 22:47.310
That goddess

22:48.350 --> 22:50.200
was the one who wanted to kill Yuanzhong.

22:48.760 --> 22:50.920
♫I've used up my brush and ink♫

22:51.110 --> 22:53.920
She made me promise her something back then,

22:51.520 --> 22:53.420
♫I couldn't describe♫

22:54.530 --> 22:58.820
♫This lovesick path with you♫

22:54.590 --> 22:56.440
to obey her commands.

22:57.960 --> 22:58.830
Tanghua.

22:59.020 --> 23:00.850
♫After the farewell, where are you now?♫

22:59.880 --> 23:01.920
She contacted me a few days ago

23:00.870 --> 23:03.510
♫Who do you spend your days with?♫

23:02.240 --> 23:03.880
and asked me to deliver a message

23:04.030 --> 23:06.960
to Yuanzhong, the High Priest. I...

23:04.890 --> 23:08.950
♫Do you know I'm willing to wait for you until the end?♫

23:07.400 --> 23:08.270
Don't say anymore.

23:08.270 --> 23:10.640
I understand.

23:10.460 --> 23:13.000
♫Sighing that the world is too lonely♫

23:12.880 --> 23:16.110
I once ruined my life out of stubbornness,

23:13.140 --> 23:15.250
♫They laugh at me for being foolish♫

23:16.370 --> 23:20.380
♫Longing is in my song; the people are not as before♫

23:16.480 --> 23:18.000
and then, step by step,

23:18.240 --> 23:19.750
I fell deeper.

23:20.270 --> 23:21.590
I was so foolish.

23:23.790 --> 23:26.110
Now, with the Demon Lord reborn,

23:26.270 --> 23:27.880
bringing chaos to the world,

23:28.190 --> 23:29.870
it's all my fault.

23:32.170 --> 23:34.000
♫After the farewell, where are you now?♫

23:33.070 --> 23:34.000
Tanghua,

23:34.030 --> 23:36.670
♫Who do you spend your days with?♫

23:35.680 --> 23:38.350
there may be a thousand important matters

23:37.370 --> 23:42.230
♫Do you know I'm willing to wait for you until the end?♫

23:38.350 --> 23:40.200
in this world,

23:41.550 --> 23:44.440
but saving me is not among them.

23:43.310 --> 23:45.840
♫Sighing that the world is too lonely♫

23:45.090 --> 23:46.610
I don't deserve to live.

23:46.220 --> 23:48.330
♫They laugh at me for being foolish♫

23:47.640 --> 23:48.550
Stay alive!

23:48.820 --> 23:52.830
♫Longing is in my song; the people are not as before♫

23:49.680 --> 23:51.640
Zhi Dai, stay alive.

23:53.510 --> 23:54.920
If I were to hold a grudge against you,

23:54.420 --> 23:58.060
♫Can't get what I yearn for, I sink in sadness♫

23:55.100 --> 23:56.450
there would only be one possibility:

23:56.960 --> 23:59.030
You gave up on the will to survive.

23:59.830 --> 24:01.880
If so, I will never forgive you,

23:59.960 --> 24:03.560
♫When I brush past love, fate is set♫

24:02.160 --> 24:03.680
and I will never forgive myself.

24:04.960 --> 24:07.550
♫I've used up my brush and ink♫

24:05.790 --> 24:06.480
Stay alive,

24:06.480 --> 24:07.880
and together, we will make up for everything.

24:07.900 --> 24:10.960
♫But I can't describe♫

24:10.000 --> 24:10.880
Alright?

24:11.130 --> 24:15.330
♫This lovesick path♫

24:15.720 --> 24:23.690
♫People are not as they were in this lifetime♫

25:10.350 --> 25:11.350
You finally came.

25:12.000 --> 25:12.890
I knew it.

25:13.350 --> 25:14.270
She would definitely come.

25:15.030 --> 25:16.830
Now, you look much more pleasing to the eye.

25:17.590 --> 25:18.400
Ji Tanyin,

25:18.640 --> 25:19.880
can you still recognize me?

25:20.550 --> 25:21.590
You're Xiu.

25:21.680 --> 25:22.880
Yes, it's me.

25:23.270 --> 25:24.160
Where's Yuanzhong?

25:24.640 --> 25:25.440
He's inside.

25:25.600 --> 25:26.400
The Demon Lord took over his body,

25:26.430 --> 25:27.720
severely damaging his spiritual consciousness.

25:27.760 --> 25:28.310
The five of us

25:28.330 --> 25:29.850
are guarding his lingering consciousness here.

25:29.880 --> 25:30.920
But the Demon Lord's devouring power

25:30.920 --> 25:31.830
is too strong.

25:31.830 --> 25:33.200
We can't hold on much longer.

25:33.350 --> 25:35.240
Yuanzhong is in a very dangerous situation right now.

25:35.350 --> 25:36.680
His consciousness is in a state that is half-dream, half-awake;

25:36.680 --> 25:37.960
half-life, half-death.

25:38.200 --> 25:39.790
We've already reached the limits of our strength.

25:40.190 --> 25:42.270
If we cannot wake him,

25:42.440 --> 25:43.830
he will be completely consumed by the Demon Lord,

25:43.880 --> 25:45.480
and both body and soul will perish.

25:49.440 --> 25:50.960
I will wake him up.

25:53.790 --> 25:54.590
Go ahead.

26:13.480 --> 26:14.270
Yuanzhong.

26:15.400 --> 26:16.200
Yuanzhong.

26:17.310 --> 26:18.790
Wake up, Yuanzhong.

26:19.480 --> 26:20.480
It's me, Tanyin.

26:21.070 --> 26:22.240
I've come to save you.

26:22.640 --> 26:23.480
You're in danger right now.

26:23.480 --> 26:24.510
You can't fall asleep.

26:24.680 --> 26:26.240
Please, wake up.

26:26.400 --> 26:27.200
Yuanzhong.

26:28.640 --> 26:30.240
Are you angry with me?

26:30.920 --> 26:32.000
You can hear me,

26:32.000 --> 26:33.030
right, Yuanzhong?

26:33.310 --> 26:34.830
Wake up, Yuanzhong.

26:39.350 --> 26:40.160
Guard it!

26:50.610 --> 26:52.110
♫Ask the heavens♫

26:52.130 --> 26:54.130
♫I don't know why I'm without a home♫

26:54.160 --> 26:55.400
♫I'm at a dead end♫

26:55.420 --> 26:57.210
♫And I have to surrender and accept my destiny♫

26:57.240 --> 26:58.960
♫I'm the wandering one♫

26:58.990 --> 27:00.790
♫My body and mind, falling into dust♫

27:00.810 --> 27:02.810
♫Only the moon in the sky♫

27:02.920 --> 27:04.330
♫Shines upon the lifelong decay♫

27:04.360 --> 27:06.460
♫The scars you can't see♫

27:05.400 --> 27:06.480
The soul lamp is about to extinguish.

27:06.490 --> 27:08.360
♫Are the proof of my struggle♫

27:06.510 --> 27:07.310
Everyone,

27:08.070 --> 27:09.240
now is the time.

27:08.400 --> 27:10.150
♫Be your own last straw of hope♫

27:09.640 --> 27:10.830
Though this life is brief,

27:10.170 --> 27:11.850
♫Why do you have to go alone?♫

27:11.680 --> 27:13.480
I find some satisfaction

27:11.880 --> 27:13.450
♫Let me learn to be fearless♫

27:13.470 --> 27:15.150
♫I live with no regrets♫

27:14.880 --> 27:15.960
in dying alongside all of you.

27:15.170 --> 27:16.540
♫Who deserves to be crushed?♫

27:16.200 --> 27:17.240
Indeed, it's quite a relief.

27:16.560 --> 27:19.060
♫Don't tell me what's right or wrong♫

27:17.640 --> 27:18.720
It's a pity we don't have wine.

27:18.750 --> 27:19.880
No wine is better.

27:19.820 --> 27:21.840
♫I rebel against fate♫

27:20.000 --> 27:20.880
At this time,

27:21.000 --> 27:22.440
who would want to hear your drunken words?

27:22.440 --> 27:23.160
True.

27:22.650 --> 27:25.700
♫I'm willing to risk my life♫

27:23.550 --> 27:24.920
If we can't come sober,

27:25.270 --> 27:26.720
at least we should leave sober.

27:26.310 --> 27:28.460
♫No matter how dangerous it is♫

27:26.880 --> 27:27.720
Well said.

27:28.110 --> 27:29.920
Then let's all go together.

27:28.770 --> 27:32.460
♫I will travel the world and scatter the fog♫

27:31.920 --> 27:33.110
The Heavenly Way above,

27:32.730 --> 27:35.500
♫The flowing water does not compete for the lead♫

27:33.200 --> 27:34.400
I am clear and pure.

27:34.680 --> 27:35.830
In the dark void of thought,

27:35.880 --> 27:39.240
♫For millennia, all will turn to dust♫

27:35.920 --> 27:37.270
I wish to uphold the law.

27:37.660 --> 27:38.820
In the vast universe,

27:39.400 --> 27:40.640
the power of Heaven is vast.

27:39.710 --> 27:42.500
♫With our feet on the earth and the sky above♫

27:40.790 --> 27:42.070
Today, I offer my body,

27:42.310 --> 27:43.590
to reject the demon with my flesh.

27:42.730 --> 27:46.250
♫We, the heroes of our time, are no ordinary beings♫

27:43.720 --> 27:44.920
Today, I offer my body,

27:44.920 --> 27:46.110
to reject the demon with my flesh.

27:46.280 --> 27:49.080
♫The flowing water does not compete for the lead♫

27:46.400 --> 27:47.640
Today, I offer my body,

27:47.750 --> 27:49.030
to reject the demon with my flesh.

27:49.340 --> 27:52.670
♫In my heart, there are no ripples, as if a god resides within♫

27:53.300 --> 27:56.170
♫I ride the wind and embrace the moon♫

27:56.270 --> 28:00.260
♫The raging river in my dreams has never ceased♫

28:00.510 --> 28:02.340
♫The flowing water does not compete for the lead♫
♫I want to be like the flowing rivers, lakes, and seas♫

28:02.360 --> 28:03.910
♫The flowing water does not compete for the lead♫
♫Vast and surging♫

28:02.920 --> 28:03.720
Yuanzhong.

28:03.930 --> 28:05.640
♫In my heart, there are no ripples, as if a god resides within♫
♫Love, hatred, gratitude, or grudges♫

28:05.660 --> 28:07.290
♫In my heart, there are no ripples, as if a god resides within♫
♫While disputes and entanglements repeated countless times♫

28:07.530 --> 28:09.320
♫I ride the wind and embrace the moon♫
♫I want to conquer the world without struggle♫

28:09.340 --> 28:10.520
♫I ride the wind and embrace the moon♫
♫Just like water that nothing can fight♫

28:10.560 --> 28:12.320
♫The raging river in my dreams has never ceased♫
♫Able to take on and let go, neither arrogant nor impatient♫

28:12.350 --> 28:15.000
♫The raging river in my dreams has never ceased♫
♫Only a steady stream can be considered humble♫

28:18.790 --> 28:19.590
Yuanzhong.

28:20.640 --> 28:22.640
In the past, you always asked me who I was,

28:25.400 --> 28:26.480
where I came from,

28:27.330 --> 28:28.850
and why I came here.

28:29.820 --> 28:31.260
I always avoided answering.

28:32.310 --> 28:33.790
Now I'm going to tell you.

28:35.350 --> 28:36.960
You must listen carefully.

28:39.640 --> 28:40.880
My name is Ji Tanyin.

28:42.780 --> 28:44.980
I am the God of Craft, bestowed by Heaven.

28:45.750 --> 28:46.920
My title is "Wushuang."

28:59.680 --> 29:00.790
Actually, we met

29:00.790 --> 29:01.880
a long time ago.

29:03.790 --> 29:05.480
At that time, I was severely injured,

29:05.960 --> 29:07.090
frozen in the Wu Mountain.

29:08.390 --> 29:09.910
You were the one who shattered the thick ice

29:09.960 --> 29:10.960
and awakened me.

29:11.960 --> 29:13.110
Back then,

29:13.960 --> 29:14.640
you were still

29:14.640 --> 29:16.230
a little fox,

29:17.000 --> 29:18.860
who took away half of my jade token.

29:23.240 --> 29:24.030
Look,

29:25.640 --> 29:27.200
I still have half of it here.

29:30.110 --> 29:31.240
Open your eyes and take a look,

29:31.240 --> 29:32.070
alright?

29:34.400 --> 29:36.440
It's one with your half.

29:37.030 --> 29:38.750
You should be able to recognize it.

29:48.510 --> 29:50.110
At that time, I was severely injured,

29:50.880 --> 29:52.030
deaf and mute.

29:53.510 --> 29:55.350
You made a wish to the jade token.

29:57.650 --> 29:58.970
That was the only voice

29:59.000 --> 30:01.000
I could hear back then.

30:05.920 --> 30:07.030
You told me

30:08.270 --> 30:10.860
that it would take twelve days

30:11.750 --> 30:13.540
to walk from Dawan to Pingzhou.

30:15.350 --> 30:16.960
You said practicing magic was difficult,

30:17.830 --> 30:19.270
but learning Taoism was faster.

30:20.550 --> 30:22.310
You said the food in the clan wasn't enough,

30:22.720 --> 30:24.590
so you often woke up hungry in the middle of the night.

30:25.720 --> 30:26.590
You also said

30:28.750 --> 30:30.270
you wanted to grow up quickly,

30:31.790 --> 30:33.920
so you could protect your family.

30:36.290 --> 30:38.180
Do you remember, Yuanzhong?

30:49.630 --> 30:50.790
Later, I came

30:50.790 --> 30:51.830
to your side.

30:55.940 --> 30:57.100
In the war between gods and demons,

30:58.110 --> 30:58.830
Deity Taihe,

30:58.830 --> 31:00.640
having lost the Divine Left Hand,

31:01.110 --> 31:02.440
fell into a deep slumber.

31:03.440 --> 31:04.400
They told me

31:04.400 --> 31:06.030
only by retrieving the Divine Hand

31:06.880 --> 31:10.510
could Taihe wake up.

31:31.570 --> 31:33.330
They said you were a bad person,

31:35.750 --> 31:37.470
said you stole the divine artifact,

31:38.920 --> 31:40.400
said you imprisoned all the clans,

31:41.150 --> 31:43.000
said you were cruel and brutal,

31:43.030 --> 31:44.240
said you deserved to die.

31:44.240 --> 31:44.960
But you are not.

31:44.960 --> 31:46.480
You are not like that.

31:47.480 --> 31:48.830
You've endured so much injustice

31:48.830 --> 31:50.480
and swallowed so much pain,

31:51.470 --> 31:53.430
yet you never harmed anyone.

31:55.590 --> 31:56.680
You're not.

31:58.200 --> 31:59.510
If I take the Divine Hand,

31:59.510 --> 32:00.640
you will die.

32:01.000 --> 32:02.480
But I don't want you to die.

32:03.790 --> 32:05.000
So I could only

32:05.680 --> 32:08.750
agree to the three conditions of the Thunder Gods.

32:10.480 --> 32:11.480
I couldn't reveal to you

32:11.480 --> 32:12.920
my true identity.

32:16.400 --> 32:17.200
I couldn't let you

32:17.230 --> 32:19.510
use the Divine Left Hand to harm the world.

32:23.110 --> 32:24.640
Also, I couldn't fall in love with you.

32:25.850 --> 32:26.850
Only in this way

32:27.400 --> 32:29.110
could I stay by your side

32:29.960 --> 32:31.880
and accompany you through this life,

32:33.110 --> 32:35.880
then take the Divine Hand back to the Divine Realm.

32:37.400 --> 32:38.550
Only in this way

32:39.200 --> 32:40.070
could I fight for

32:40.070 --> 32:41.880
a glimmer of hope for you.

32:44.240 --> 32:46.310
But Yuanzhong, I didn't expect...

32:47.240 --> 32:48.000
I didn't expect

32:48.000 --> 32:49.480
that in the end, this would harm you.

32:52.720 --> 32:55.000
In the past, I was bound by the oath and couldn't tell you.

32:55.680 --> 32:56.750
I also didn't have the courage to speak.

32:58.310 --> 32:59.720
But now, at this point,

33:00.480 --> 33:01.270
there's nothing left

33:01.270 --> 33:02.680
for me to hide.

33:07.480 --> 33:08.680
Now, I want to tell you something.

33:10.000 --> 33:11.240
Listen carefully.

33:14.920 --> 33:15.790
I love you.

33:18.240 --> 33:19.790
I love you so much.

33:22.070 --> 33:23.820
You are the only person I've loved

33:23.920 --> 33:24.830
in both my human and divine lives,

33:24.830 --> 33:26.310
across all these millennia.

33:26.960 --> 33:28.000
You are obsessive

33:28.970 --> 33:30.010
but also forgiving.

33:31.000 --> 33:32.000
You are fierce

33:32.750 --> 33:34.000
but also compassionate.

33:34.710 --> 33:35.920
Your heart is filled with

33:35.920 --> 33:37.240
anger and resentment,

33:37.960 --> 33:39.480
but in the final moment,

33:39.480 --> 33:41.240
you were able to let go of your hatred.

33:43.000 --> 33:44.720
The world treats you with evil,

33:44.130 --> 33:46.280
♫Time never defeats the fleeting world♫

33:45.070 --> 33:46.440
but you return it with kindness.

33:47.150 --> 33:49.670
♫Stars turn, shining upon the passing traveler♫

33:48.480 --> 33:49.400
Someone like that

33:50.270 --> 33:51.400
is worthy of my love.

33:51.430 --> 33:54.130
♫The wind rises, flowers fall and bloom again♫

33:54.360 --> 33:57.530
♫Awaiting what's lost to be regained♫

33:58.600 --> 34:01.120
♫These countless sorrows and joys♫

34:01.690 --> 34:05.990
♫Dusk and dawn, only you make parting hard♫

34:05.720 --> 34:07.070
You are exactly that kind of person.

34:06.130 --> 34:12.690
♫I'm willing to risk my life for this♫

34:07.750 --> 34:09.630
I've looked into your heart and seen it.

34:11.920 --> 34:13.400
You are the kind of person

34:12.830 --> 34:15.280
♫Wind chimes beat with my heart♫

34:13.400 --> 34:15.150
who can bloom amidst the icy snow.

34:15.880 --> 34:17.110
So you never give up,

34:16.010 --> 34:19.050
♫Harmonizing, can you recognize it?♫

34:17.110 --> 34:18.550
and you won't give up.

34:20.360 --> 34:21.760
Wake up, Yuanzhong.

34:20.400 --> 34:23.260
♫Fingertips tracing your outline♫

34:22.320 --> 34:24.070
Please wake up quickly.

34:23.679 --> 34:26.409
♫I wish to see through you♫

34:24.960 --> 34:27.070
I once met a sorcerer.

34:27.679 --> 34:30.400
♫Whether near or far♫

34:28.110 --> 34:30.280
He said you would live a peaceful and long life.

34:30.360 --> 34:32.429
He claimed his divination was spot-on,

34:31.250 --> 34:35.400
♫We can still gaze upon the same galaxy♫

34:32.840 --> 34:34.110
so you will wake up,

34:34.110 --> 34:34.880
won't you?

34:35.190 --> 34:36.000
Yuanzhong.

34:36.080 --> 34:40.960
♫Knowing we've never been apart for a moment♫

34:37.000 --> 34:37.800
Yuanzhong.

34:38.320 --> 34:40.000
Wake up, please.

34:40.710 --> 34:41.510
Yuanzhong.

34:42.139 --> 34:45.010
♫If our promise♫

34:45.210 --> 34:49.489
♫Is to share this land and rivers♫

34:49.690 --> 34:52.380
♫If fate leads us astray♫

34:52.780 --> 34:56.449
♫Life and death become our bond♫

34:54.670 --> 34:55.480
No.

34:56.850 --> 34:59.570
♫Storms heal with time♫

34:57.320 --> 34:58.920
Yuanzhong, I won't allow you to die!

34:59.230 --> 35:00.030
Yuanzhong!

35:00.050 --> 35:04.870
♫Memories will shine in the end♫

35:01.230 --> 35:02.030
Yuanzhong!

35:04.900 --> 35:10.260
♫That very first heartbeat, I will remember until the last♫

35:11.320 --> 35:14.190
♫If our promise♫

35:14.210 --> 35:18.500
♫Is to share this land and rivers♫

35:18.030 --> 35:18.840
No!

35:18.690 --> 35:21.390
♫If fate leads us astray♫

35:21.660 --> 35:25.340
♫Life and death become our bond♫

35:25.760 --> 35:28.860
♫Storms heal with time♫

35:28.970 --> 35:33.780
♫Memories will shine in the end♫

35:33.910 --> 35:39.260
♫That very first heartbeat, I will remember until the last♫

35:41.060 --> 35:47.680
♫That very first heartbeat, I will remember until the last♫

36:08.710 --> 36:09.960
Is he dead?

36:17.400 --> 36:18.590
What a pity.

36:46.080 --> 36:46.740
Get lost!

36:50.440 --> 36:51.880
What nonsense are you talking about?

36:52.280 --> 36:53.280
I have ascended to divinity

36:53.280 --> 36:54.550
for three thousand years.

36:54.570 --> 36:55.610
Can you withstand the strength of my power?

36:58.000 --> 36:59.190
Are you feeling very sad?

37:02.080 --> 37:03.250
He's dead.

37:07.550 --> 37:09.550
This is actually great news.

37:10.100 --> 37:11.140
Let me take some time

37:11.710 --> 37:12.760
to think it through.

37:13.440 --> 37:15.030
How should I thank you?

37:15.150 --> 37:16.440
Give him back to me.

37:16.630 --> 37:17.670
Give him back to you?

37:19.190 --> 37:20.360
I am him.

37:20.800 --> 37:22.510
I'm giving you the privilege to follow me. Sounds good?

37:22.530 --> 37:24.030
Give Yuanzhong back to me!

37:44.860 --> 37:46.220
Don't you love me anymore?

37:47.590 --> 37:48.510
Don't you want to

37:48.510 --> 37:49.590
be with me anymore?

37:49.590 --> 37:51.110
Give Yuanzhong back to me.

37:52.710 --> 37:53.800
I can sense

37:53.800 --> 37:55.760
the power of resentment within you,

37:55.880 --> 37:57.230
but this hatred isn't deep

37:57.230 --> 37:58.110
or strong enough.

37:58.480 --> 37:59.960
Let me help you out.

38:02.800 --> 38:04.840
You lost your divine bone, broke your vow,

38:04.840 --> 38:06.070
and caused the death of your lover.

38:06.320 --> 38:07.840
Why are you still alive?

38:08.190 --> 38:09.480
What are you struggling for?

38:13.670 --> 38:14.480
Qian Yue!

38:20.960 --> 38:22.280
You brought this upon yourself.

39:09.280 --> 39:10.070
Yuanzhong.

39:21.760 --> 39:22.760
I'm back.

39:29.050 --> 39:30.130
You're not dead?

39:30.760 --> 39:32.470
You look so disappointed.

39:34.690 --> 39:35.900
Since you're still alive,

39:36.630 --> 39:38.000
then I'll kill you again.

39:38.070 --> 39:39.880
This is the realm of my spiritual consciousness.

39:40.480 --> 39:41.400
In here,

39:41.760 --> 39:43.960
I have control over everything in heaven and earth.

39:44.280 --> 39:45.760
Yet you want to kill me here?

40:17.900 --> 40:21.320
Is this the primordial power?

40:21.320 --> 40:22.760
This is the power of salvation.

40:23.770 --> 40:25.520
You will never understand.

41:19.820 --> 41:23.140
♫Going through thousands of years♫

41:23.910 --> 41:27.090
♫In exchange for a dreamlike love♫

41:27.840 --> 41:30.890
♫If the wind is all yours♫

41:31.110 --> 41:35.110
♫No bitterness in your expression♫

41:35.580 --> 41:38.560
♫Everyone comes without a match♫

41:38.630 --> 41:43.200
♫Why are they willing to be gentle?♫

41:43.440 --> 41:47.310
♫Under the clouds, the good days♫

41:47.350 --> 41:51.510
♫Come and go in a flash♫

41:53.070 --> 41:56.800
♫Like the wind and moon, I'm filled with love♫

41:57.050 --> 42:00.490
♫But it makes people go to the end of the world♫

42:00.920 --> 42:04.790
♫Willingly going through dawn and dusk♫

42:04.940 --> 42:08.380
♫To embrace you and listen to the rain♫

42:08.730 --> 42:12.280
♫Only then can I know what is memorable♫

42:12.760 --> 42:16.380
♫When I can only look back at you♫

42:16.700 --> 42:20.500
♫If there's still a way to continue♫

42:20.720 --> 42:25.430
♫I'll go no matter what♫

42:26.300 --> 42:31.730
♫I'll go no matter what♫

42:58.840 --> 43:00.160
How ignorant.
